From 4933413a0016e18f732368b1230f923b7c2e1966 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 02:00:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Rebuild the site as Broadcast: monochrome Geist through a CRT
 shader

The page stays ordinary HTML. A client component mounts src/lib/crt.js,
which mirrors #page onto a canvas and draws it through Matt Sephton's
Serenity CRT shader (MIT). Black by default; the invert control flips to
white with a TV power cycle and the choice persists in localStorage.

- Home: name, intro line, experiments, contact/linkedin/invert footer
- Contact: same form, validation and API route; red error state
- Remove the Inria Serif logo, Header component and Hugeicons deps

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UNsktdWxri7c8KBgQu129Q
